[
  {
    "route": "/en/privacy-policy",
    "title": "Privacy Policy",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "rank": 2,
        "variant": "section",
        "flush": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "What will we use your information for?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "If necessary, we collect the information specified in the inquiry form (name and surname, e-mail, phone number, etc.). Otherwise, you may use our website anonymously."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "rank": 2,
        "variant": "section",
        "flush": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "What information do we collect?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "We may use your personal and non-personal information in one of the following ways:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "For the purpose of personalised communication, i.e. providing information in accordance with your actual needs."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "For the purpose of improving this website."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "For the purpose of better understanding the needs of potential patients and website users."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "For sending occasional e-mails informing you about benefits and new services."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Note: if at any time you wish to unsubscribe from receiving future e-mails, you may do so in accordance with the instructions at the bottom of each e-mail."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "rank": 2,
        "variant": "section",
        "flush": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "How do we protect your personal information?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "We implement a range of security measures to maintain the confidentiality of your personal data at all times: when you access the website, when you send us an inquiry using the web form or when sending an e-mail."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "rank": 2,
        "variant": "section",
        "flush": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "What do we use cookies for?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Cookies are small files that we transfer to your computer's hard drive through your web browser (if you allow this), which enable us to recognise users and remember certain information related to them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Thanks to this information, we may in the future offer higher-quality and more precise information about our services. For the purpose of analysing this data, we may engage a third party to assist us. In doing so, at no time does the third party acquire the right to use the data for any purpose other than the one previously stated, nor is it authorised to disclose such data to third parties."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "If you wish, you may choose an option on your computer that informs you each time a cookie is sent, or you may choose to completely disable all cookies."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "rank": 2,
        "variant": "section",
        "flush": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Who can use my personal data?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Your personal data will never become the subject of sale and will not be transferred, with or without compensation, to a third party for the purpose of commercial exploitation."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Non-personal data collected during an anonymous visit to this website may be provided to a third party for the purpose of improving promotion and marketing."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "rank": 2,
        "variant": "section",
        "flush": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Independent links"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Occasionally, at our discretion, we may place links to third-party websites on this website. Please note that those websites have separate and independent privacy policies. Therefore, we have no responsibility for the content and your activities on those websites. Since it is in our interest to protect the integrity of our website, any feedback regarding those websites is welcome."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "rank": 2,
        "variant": "section",
        "flush": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Children's Online Privacy Protection Act Compliance"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "This Privacy Policy document on online privacy protection applies only to data collected through our website, and not to data collected in any other way."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "rank": 2,
        "variant": "section",
        "flush": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Terms"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Please see the "
          },
          {
            "kind": "link",
            "href": "/en/terms-of-use",
            "children": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "text": "terms of use"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " of our website."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "rank": 2,
        "variant": "section",
        "flush": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Your consent"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "By using our website, you agree to this Privacy Policy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "rank": 2,
        "variant": "section",
        "flush": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Changes to the Privacy Policy"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "If, for any reason, we change the terms of this Policy, the changes will be published on this page."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, you may contact us in writing or orally at:"
          }
        ]
      },
