    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "These Terms of Use define the terms governing the use of the website www.dentvitalis.com (hereinafter: the “Website”). The owner of the content on the Website is Dentvitalis Fides d.o.o. Krešimirova 60, 51000 Rijeka, Croatia. If you do not agree with one or more provisions of these Terms, please leave the Website and refrain from using it further."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "break"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "All dental services published on this Website are provided by Dentvitalis Fides d.o.o. (hereinafter: “DVF”) in its own name and for its own account."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "1. All information relating to the dental services listed on the Website, including the relevant prices and treatment timeframes, is provided for informational purposes only and may not replace the treatment plan that is issued to each individual patient following an examination by a dentist at the DVF clinic."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "2. Any treatment plan and corresponding financial offer sent to a patient by email or by any other means are provided for information purposes only, as they are prepared on the basis of incomplete information, and, in particular, without an examination of the patient at the DVF clinic."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "3. The content of this Website is subject to change without prior written or oral notice to users."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "4. All content on the Website, including its design, is the intellectual property of Dentvitalis Fides d.o.o. and may not be used without its prior written consent."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "variant": "body",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "5. Any links to other websites are provided in good faith and solely for the purpose of offering users additional information. DVF accepts no responsibility for the content of such websites."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "rank": 2,
        "variant": "section",
        "flush": false,
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "strong",
            "children": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "text": "Disclaimer"
              }
            ]
          }
